Package: learnr2
Title: Interactive Tutorials with Quarto and WebR
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R:
    person("David", "Kane", , "dave.kane@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Create interactive R tutorials that run entirely in the
    browser using Quarto and WebR via the 'quarto-live' extension. Provides
    learnr-style authoring conveniences -- scaffolding, exercises, hints,
    solutions, and quizzes -- without Shiny, R Markdown, or a server.
